        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-30T20:49:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I appreciate that this thread has calmed down. Still, given the negativity, I want to be clear about some things:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>The first rule on The Forum Discourse Rules (</span><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/official-rules-part-2-forum-discourse-rules-4236\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/official-rules-part-2-forum-discourse-rules-4236</a><span>) is 'Do not post pejoratives about other people'.&nbsp;There have been a bunch of insults and aspersions. It needs to stop. Even if you're angry. Even if the other person seems patently wrong and rude. Even if your profession has been dismissed. Even if you've been insulted or dishonered. <strong>If you can't state your opinion without using an insult, don't do it.</strong> If you feel that someone else has misbehaved and needs to face justice, report it to the Moderators.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"PT Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span>I recognize that the above isn't always easy or fun. If there's someone else whose posts cause you to be upset, we want to know about it. We don't, however, want to see negative comments and flame wars.</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"PT Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span>Because &nbsp;I don't like ending things on a negative note, I offer you this picture of me dressed as the Dish Fairy at Halloween.</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#444444\" face=\"PT Sans, HelveticaNeue, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><span><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></span></font></p>",
