        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-09T21:58:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We fought Skinweaver in Silver Gulch our first (and only) time.&nbsp; Those Explosives Wagons really jack up the pain on everyone.&nbsp; And when they finally go off... *shudder*</p>",
        "post_number": 83,
        "post_type": 1,
