      {
        "id": 85142,
        "name": "Gislef",
        "username": "Gislef",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-10T01:35:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We tried another fight tonight, with Realm of Discord and... Legacy, Wraith, DW Ex-Pat, and Haka. We did better, and we might have won, but it was kind of boring. There's just too many hit points of things that you have to shoot to get to Skinwalker. Three 25-HP relics, however many 9-HP voodoo pins... I don't think we had time to damage Skinwalker until Turn 8, and we got him to flip on Turn 13. We had Legacy running interference with Lead... + Next evolution to prevent melee, and lots of healing from Positive Energy Force and Legacy's healing power. We probably could have won, but after 13 turns and 45 minutes, it just didn't seem worth it to slog through.</p>",
        "post_number": 84,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:08:43.337Z",
