      {
        "id": 85143,
        "name": "Gislef",
        "username": "Gislef",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-10T15:13:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe we should fight Skinwalker on Wagner? Only three targets there...</p><p>And that's the other problem. Besides Skinwalker having 21 minions, his \"when a non-villain target is destroyed\" ability on his starting guarantees that you'll draw several extras beyond the once-per-turn basis. Given three of those have 25 HP, and two of them give Skinwalker protection from damage, it's very hard to make a dent in him.</p>",
